{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415039","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415039","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041503901:1":{"text":"친구, 오랜만에 봐도 전혀 변하지 않았군. 예전처럼... 여전히 재미없어.","source_cn":"老朋友，这么长时间没见，你没有变啊，依然如此……无趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x970F9DD608B21C5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503902:1":{"text":"흥, 경박한 자식.","source_cn":"哼，轻浮的小子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C828EDFC88D1350","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503903:1":{"text":"네가 매일 술을 마시는 것 말고 제대로 된 일을 하는 걸 본 적이 없어.","source_cn":"你每天除了喝酒还是喝酒，吾从没见你干过什么正事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEC76970662E3D95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503904:1":{"text":"젊은이들에게 좋지 못한 본보기야.","source_cn":"对于年轻人，你实在是个太坏的榜样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A6EB3F186FBFD13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503905:1":{"text":"던릴, 너는 시간의 소중함을 모르지. 아는 거라곤 그 낡아빠진 음악을 연주하는 것뿐이잖아?","source_cn":"顿里尔，你从不懂光阴珍贵，只知道拨弄你那些陈腐的乐章。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0B65432802426A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503906:1":{"text":"자네의 가르침을 들은 젊은이들은 분명 인생의 나락으로 가는 불행한 길을 걷게 될 거야.","source_cn":"如果哪个年轻人听了你的教诲，才是不幸提前踏上了生之暮路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2B34DDF9D03F6AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503907:1":{"text":"샤키탈리스, 경박하기만 한 게 아니라 멍청하기까지 하군.","source_cn":"萨基塔里斯，你不仅轻浮，而且愚蠢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x972F73440617CFC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041503908:1":{"text":"던릴, 너는 고리타분하고 편협하기까지 하네.","source_cn":"顿里尔，你不仅迂腐，还肚量狭隘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38A5E2AF2E3AC3A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041503909:1":{"text":"난 그저 솔직한 내 생각을 말했을 뿐인데, 그런 나에게 경박하고 멍청하다는 낙인을 찍다니.","source_cn":"我只不过诚实地说出了自己的想法，就被你盖上了轻浮愚蠢的帽子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0DCAC352569E52F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041503910:1":{"text":"진정해. 나는 술을 마시러 온 거지 법정에서처럼 논쟁을 벌이러 온 게 아니야.","source_cn":"放轻松，我是来小酌的，不是来法庭争辩的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47C7118EDEB40EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041503911:1":{"text":"흥, 역시나 입만 살았군.","source_cn":"哼，搬弄口舌的雀鸟都不如你会说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDC3BD689311F6D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041503912:1":{"text":"칭찬인 걸로 알지.","source_cn":"那可真是谢谢夸奖。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB974946AD1B05EEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041503913:1":{"text":"네가 있는 줄 알았다면 차라리 연주나 하러 갔을 텐데!","source_cn":"早知道你在，吾不如回去谱乐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x257903A0912C79E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041503914:1":{"text":"솔직히 나는 자네 음악을 좋아해. 웅장하고 격앙된 느낌이라, 듣는 사람을 흥분하게 만들거든.","source_cn":"说真的，我很欣赏你的音乐。它们宏大激昂，一听就让人振奋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x436815123DF34917","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041503915:1":{"text":"하지만 때론 삶에 차분하고 여유로운 음악이 필요하다는 걸 배워야 할 때가 있지.","source_cn":"但有的时候，你得学会在生活中插入一些舒缓悠闲的小调。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F4FD6372D6E61CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041503916:1":{"text":"바로 지금 이 순간처럼... 가득 찬 술잔을 앞에 두고 진지하고 재미없는 이야기를 나누는 건 어울리지 않는 것 같군.","source_cn":"就好像此刻……杯中美酒满溢，实在不适合发生这么严肃无趣...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83D0F26EA12A8E3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:萨基塔里斯":{"text":"샤키탈리스","source":"萨基塔里斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:顿里尔":{"text":"던릴","source":"顿里尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":2}}